{"id":"5d90a8b02bde0aa76f35de8f53d95cd8f2d26fd0","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"5d90a8b02bde0aa76f35de8f53d95cd8f2d26fd0","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/rebuild-skips-empty-side-effects.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@","+---","+\"pacquet\": patch","+\"@pnpm/napi\": patch","+---","+","+A `rebuild` with `skipIfHasSideEffectsCache` ran the build scripts of a package again when the side-effects cache recorded that its build changed nothing inside the package, such as a native addon whose optional compilation failed. Such a rebuild now skips these packages, as pnpm v11's `rebuild` did. An install still runs their build scripts."],"additions":6,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/deps-restorer/src/build_modules.rs","lines":["@@ -503,7 +503,11 @@ impl BuildModules<'_> {","             can_write_store: self.cache.store_index_writer.is_some()","                 && self.cache.store_dir.is_some(),","             has_packages: self.graph.packages.is_some(),","-            has_cache_rows: self.cache.maps_by_snapshot.is_some_and(|map| !map.is_empty()),","+            // A rebuild that skips cached builds also reads the empty rows","+            // the overlays leave out.","+            has_cache_rows: self.cache.side_effects.has_overlays()","+                || (self.rebuild.is_some_and(|rebuild| rebuild.skip_if_has_side_effects_cache)","+                    && self.cache.side_effects.has_rows()),","         });","         let graph = cache_gate_active.then(|| {","             // Every requires-build snapshot is a root, including the ones"],"additions":5,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/deps-restorer/src/build_modules/build_one_snapshot/side_effects.rs","lines":["@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@"," use super::{","     super::{","-        BuildModulesError, PackageKey, Path, Reporter, materialize_side_effects,","-        store_index_key_for_resolution,","+        BuildModulesError, NEEDS_BUILD_MARKER, PackageKey, Path, Reporter,","+        materialize_side_effects, store_index_key_for_resolution,","     },","     BuildCandidate, BuildOneSnapshot, global_slot_carries_overlay, report_broken_slot,"," };","@@ -67,10 +67,8 @@ pub(super) fn already_built<Reporter: self::Reporter>("," ) -> Result<bool, BuildModulesError> {","     if !bypasses_side_effects_cache(context, candidate)","         && context.cache.read","-        && let Some(maps_by_snapshot) = context.cache.maps_by_snapshot","-        && let Some(maps) = maps_by_snapshot.get(snapshot_key)","         && let Some(key) = cache_key","-        && let Some(overlay) = maps.get(key)","+        && let Some(overlay) = context.cache.side_effects.overlay(snapshot_key, key)","     {","         return satisfy_from_side_effects_cache::<Reporter>(","             context,","@@ -79,7 +77,40 @@ pub(super) fn already_built<Reporter: self::Reporter>(","             (&candidate.name, &candidate.version),","         );","     }","-    Ok(false)","+    Ok(rebuild_found_empty_row(context, snapshot_key, cache_key))","+}","+/// A rebuild with [`RebuildOptions::skip_if_has_side_effects_cache`]","+/// skips a package whose side-effects row for this cache key is empty.","+/// The build ran before and changed nothing inside the package, so there","+/// is nothing to restore, and running it again would only repeat that.","+/// pnpm v11's `rebuild` takes any row as a hit the same way, unless the","+/// package directory carries [`NEEDS_BUILD_MARKER`]: that slot has not","+/// been built yet. An install still runs such a build, because its effect","+/// may lie outside the package directory (pnpm/pnpm#14717).","+///","+/// [`RebuildOptions::skip_if_has_side_effects_cache`]: crate::RebuildOptions::skip_if_has_side_effects_cache","+fn rebuild_found_empty_row(","+    context: &BuildOneSnapshot<'_>,","+    snapshot_key: &PackageKey,","+    cache_key: Option<&str>,","+) -> bool {","+    let hit = context.rebuild.is_some_and(|rebuild| rebuild.skip_if_has_side_effects_cache)","+        && context.cache.read","+        && cache_key.is_some_and(|key| context.cache.side_effects.has_empty_row(snapshot_key, key))","+        && !context","+            .pkg_roots()","+            .all_recorded(snapshot_key)","+            .iter()","+            .any(|pkg_dir| pkg_dir.join(NEEDS_BUILD_MARKER).exists());","+    if hit {","+        tracing::debug!(","+            target: \"pacquet::build\",","+            ?snapshot_key,","+            cache_key,","+            \"side-effects cache holds an empty build; skipping the rebuild\",","+        );","+    }","+    hit"," }"," fn bypasses_side_effects_cache(","     context: &BuildOneSnapshot<'_>,"],"additions":37,"deletions":6,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/deps-restorer/src/build_modules/tests.rs","lines":["@@ -21,6 +21,9 @@ mod build_policy;"," #[cfg(unix)]"," mod gvs_markers;"," ","+#[cfg(unix)]","+mod empty_side_effects;","+"," use super::{BuildModules, allow_build_policy::AllowBuildPolicy};"," // Only the `#[cfg(unix)]` rebuild-selection test uses this; importing it"," // unconditionally would be an unused import on Windows.","@@ -176,7 +179,7 @@ fn frozen_backstop_run("," ","     BuildModules {","         cache: crate::BuildCacheContext {","-            maps_by_snapshot: None,","+            side_effects: crate::CachedSideEffects { overlays: None, rows: None },","             engine_name: None,","             read: false,","             write: false,"],"additions":4,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/deps-restorer/src/build_modules/tests/build_policy.rs","lines":["@@ -124,7 +124,7 @@ fn build_modules_collects_ignored_builds() {"," ","     let ignored = BuildModules {","         cache: crate::BuildCacheContext {","-            maps_by_snapshot: None,","+            side_effects: crate::CachedSideEffects { overlays: None, rows: None },","             engine_name: None,","             read: true,","             write: false,","@@ -209,7 +209,7 @@ fn mutated_slots_is_false_when_every_build